    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29599" root="عطف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْطُوفٌ</span></b>  [<i>Inclined,</i> or <i>bent:</i> &amp;c.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْطُوفَةٌ</span> <i>An Arabian bow,</i> (IDrd, S, O, K, *) <i>of
which the curved extremity is much bent towards
it, and which is used for</i> [<i>shooting at</i>] <i>the butts:</i>
(IDrd, O, K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ عَطْفَى</span></b>  signifies the
same. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطْفٌ</span>, in two places.

